					title: "Blue Petal (water)"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					item: "botania:brown_petal"
					id: "1CC07247E7BE607C"
					title: "Brown Petal (earth)"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					item: "botania:white_petal"
					id: "4863A8829AF05552"
					title: "White Petal (air)"
					type: "item"
				}
				]
				title: "Petal Apothecary"
				x: 1.5d
				y: -2.0d
			}
			{
				dependencies: ["3AFE4C91FE577BFD"]
				description: [
					"the &6pure daisy&r (apothecary, plain petals + seeds -- deliberately cheap) placed next to stone makes &6livingrock&r; next to wood makes livingwood."
					""
					"livingrock isn't flavor here -- it's the ashen ichor blend reagent, the spirit altar's own build cost, and the blood altar's build cost. keep a stack on hand from turn one."
				]
				id: "62F896951CAD2872"
				shape: "hexagon"
				size: 1.25d
				subtitle: "a hard requirement, not a decoration"
				tasks: [{
					item: "botania:livingrock"
					id: "501C07B19DAC8861"
					count: 4L
					type: "item"
				}]
				title: "Pure Daisy"
				x: 3.0d
				y: -2.0d
			}
			{
				dependencies: ["6135CDA5AA58E147"]
				description: [
					"break grass for &ddemon's dream&r seeds, farm the plant, compress fruit/seeds into &ddemon's dream essence&r, then throw it on the ground and light it with flint & steel -- &dspiritfire&r."
					""
					"throw items into the flame to convert them: andesite -> &dotherstone&r, oak sapling -> otherworld sapling, feather -> &dawakened feather&r, black dye -> &dpurified ink&r, book -> &dtaboo book&r, and impure chalk -> pure &6white chalk&r. these five conversions are the backbone of everything occultism does from here on."
				]
				id: "3C9F8E8606AC1E24"
				shape: "rsquare"
				subtitle: "light the veil on fire"
				tasks: [{
					item: "occultism:otherworld_essence"
					id: "663F19213D4C571F"
					title: "Otherworld Essence"
					type: "item"
				}]
				title: "Spiritfire"
				x: 1.5d
				y: 1.5d
			}
			{
				dependencies: ["3C9F8E8606AC1E24"]
				description: [
					"an empty book of binding is taboo book + awakened feather + purified ink. dye it white for a &6book of binding: foliot&r, then craft it with the &ddictionary of spirits&r to name it -- that binds it to a specific summon."
					""
					"the dictionary itself: 3x paper, botania livingwood (the spine must be living), and a slime ball (a real vanilla stand-in for gt's own glue). craft otherstone sacrificial bowls, one golden bowl, and tallow candles (kill large animals with a &6butcher knife&r) -- then draw the pentacle, fill the bowls, and right-click the golden bowl with the bound book."
				]
				id: "02C3307D419D7F32"
				shape: "rsquare"
				subtitle: "paper, feather, ink, and a name"
				tasks: [{
					item: "occultism:golden_sacrificial_bowl"
					id: "07DA60D51DA81AF2"
					type: "item"
				}]
				title: "Books of Binding"
				x: 3.0d
				y: 1.5d
			}
			{
				dependencies: ["02C3307D419D7F32"]
				description: [
					"summon a &6foliot&r -- occultism's lowest-tier helper. this quest tracks the &blumberjack&r ritual specifically; you can also bind a foliot to &bcleaner&r or &bitem transport&r duty afterward."
					""
					"every foliot ritual in this pack additionally costs a plain &6fire charge&r (unmodified vanilla recipe) as a gate item. cheap, and required -- apprentice assumes you have logistics help."
				]
				id: "426B74354D3A5B86"
