				description: [
					"blood magic's &4blood altar&r isn't a plain grid craft here -- it's infused &6at the spirit altar&r: a furnace + arcane charcoal fragments + stone + gold plates + livingrock, sealed with 4x &6wicked spirit&r."
					""
					"right-click air near it with a &4sacrificial dagger&r: 1 heart = 200 LP. bind a &6weak blood orb&r (diamond + 2,000 LP at tier 0) -- every LP cost in this pack draws from your soul network through a bound orb, not the altar directly. place blood runes to raise the tier: 8 for tier 1, 28 for tier 2."
