				description: [
					"the full chain: arcane charcoal fragments + redstone brew into &6ichor dust&r in the cauldron (lava, heated). blend in a pinch of &6livingrock&r for &6livingrock ichor blend&r, then charge it at the &4blood altar&r (250 LP, tier 0) into &6kindled ichor dust&r."
					""
					"smelt the kindled dust into a rough ingot, then finish it at the &6spirit altar&r with 2x &6infernal spirit&r -- &6ashen ichor&r, a real GT material from here on. `.ingot()` + `GENERATE_ROD` only, no plate form. shortcut once you hit apprentice: vinteum dust + arcane charcoal fragment at the alchemy table, batch of 2, no altar chain needed."
